    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-c3ffd09d-61b4-46cc-bb10-e3045eafc582" n="2126" facs="#m-b9e10afe-8d69-4c72-853c-7966374a5897" /><div xml:id="m-51f721fa-591f-4d2d-8328-cb0cdac8c56e">
            <lg xml:id="m-52c2a2b6-72df-43c0-a341-59d28e9cca90">
              <l xml:id="m-00c10fe8-dc9a-47d8-ac1c-788670624d3b" facs="#m-94b6e947-5413-4989-b8ab-538a329b33eb" label="ambiguous">1882</l><l xml:id="m-60a970ce-906a-41a3-a1f4-a6f65cefcb05" facs="#m-0183b5dc-9167-438d-9787-011dac38fe4f" label="text-like">Litany of St. Joseph.</l><l xml:id="m-71da566d-3792-42af-afaf-93053c4e16fc" facs="#m-e0bd4c87-063c-4f72-b64e-1a7c616bece0" label="lyrics-like">V. Constítuit éum dóminum dómus súae.</l><l xml:id="m-60da4d2a-dd94-4597-b60c-9eed36ca2d13" facs="#m-f1e9a8d6-4706-4737-b445-93e9e9406fed" label="lyrics-like">N. Et principem ómnis possessiónis súae.</l><l xml:id="m-fa44e161-64f7-4165-8b5f-5e16f3234712" facs="#m-b4b831f6-b3e4-4b70-b92c-a66fd2ec19e0" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-416079a5-2f9d-4124-94fd-9be5b6e29de2" facs="#m-a5ffc5b6-b10c-42e4-88e7-a26795a1919b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ineffábili providéntia ut quem protectórem venerámur in</l><l xml:id="m-83c76e59-5ca5-46e8-a60c-b8d97c250426" facs="#m-40496c80-e00b-477b-863b-505614ed7741" label="lyrics-like">A beátum Joseph sanctissimae terris, * intercessórem habére me¬</l><l xml:id="m-9656f124-15f6-469d-897b-345681c6dd78" facs="#m-251d12b8-bf34-4033-9c3a-8cba080fdec0" label="lyrics-like">Genitricis tuae sponsum eligere di-reámur in caelis : Qui vivis et regnas</l><l xml:id="m-10f81288-4de4-493e-9fa0-529af0af6881" facs="#m-d53d7ce4-13d1-4289-9d91-1222beac6270" label="lyrics-like">gnátus es: f praesta, quaésumus; in saécula saeculórum. Amen.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
